    "description": "Town hall, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Needs scaffolding: 18 tall (the clock tower; the hall roof is 15). Over budget: 1159 blocks vs 740 (first build 1051 vs 620). Half-timbered council hall raised on an open stone market arcade, a stone clock tower at the front with a clock face on every side and a vaulted porch; council chamber with a long table, the mayor's seat and records, the clerks' office in the tower, a stair at the back, a notice board; L2 clock hands, records shelves, lanterns, banners and market stalls; L3 the clocks (decoration step), flower boxes, benches, flowers and a lantern post. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, bookshelf, candle, cornflower, dark_oak_button, lectern, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner, vine. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, item_frame, sign_text.",
